<title>UK: JGBs gain in London, helped by firm yen.</title>
<headline>JGBs gain in London, helped by firm yen.</headline>
<text>
<p>1430 GMT - JGBs shift to forward gear in London again after giving up early gains in Tokyo following weaker than expected April machinery orders. Yen firm. Eyes on Tankan survey on June 25.</p>
<p>* Sept JGB futures at 123.20 vs 123.14 Tokyo close</p>
<p>* Benchmark 182nd cash JGB yields 2.480 percent from 2.485 in Tokyo</p>
